From 8c15ffb2fb68cc50483a6913a7a133c394c591cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:08:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] [jakompiled] web runtime: WasmFS + OPFS, play from the
 extracted ISO

gk uses WasmFS. Before the runtime starts, out/<game>/iso is filled with links to the files built
from the user's ISO in OPFS (DGO/CGO, text, and the ISO's STR/SBK/MUS/VAG/SCREEN1 files) and
out/<game>/fr3 links to the extracted levels; without an extracted ISO, the CGO files served with
the page are used. The user directory (settings, save games) lives in OPFS.
