 web/CMakeLists.txt     |   7 ++-
 web/runtime_fs_web.cpp | 109 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 web/runtime_fs_web.cpp

